	(text_box "NOTES:\n\nB. IC sockets: these chips are not sold by LCSC, so the board gets a round-pin DIP socket\nand the chip is bought separately and inserted after assembly.\nU201: MOS 6510 CPU\nU504 (VIC-II sheet): 8562 VIC-II (NTSC). A 6567 does not work: it needs 12 V on pin 13.\nU1701 (SID sheet): 8580 SID. A 6581 does not work: it needs 12 V on VDD."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
